<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to issue T$30 bln bond on March 11.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to issue T$30 bln bond on March 11.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's finance ministry will issue T$30 billion in 10-year construction bonds on March 11, a finance ministry official said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Initial auction date for the bonds was set for March 11, with official issuance on March 14, the official added.</p>
<p>The ministry will commission the central bank to conduct the bond auction, the official said.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
